{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_30003_01_c",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:b6c21103f5bea4129adb1d8b77a596bee8aa71394ee841cf810f5a4435493ccd",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_c:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e85e1ae1e9258d7f897ed76ad8213efd1217586d5a510994d2936cbb89391e18",
      "text": "一直在琢磨怎么回答会更受欢迎、怎么做显得更帅，\n结果根本停不下来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_c:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:65451aae5f4a35482de780a96e9b30eb2aace84fbb3b63975b9bc391ffa6c3f7",
      "text": "回过神来天就已经亮了。\n啊哈哈……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_c:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d5db7cc6959a949a4b944de6ae420733b2de5a2c12901d9457c11db947ceccd8",
      "text": "唉……光凭想象，\n亏你能兴奋成那样……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_c:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f69c451201273e6f10fb46f346a31fe23e48da76a065bc6cb20876e40779d44c",
      "text": "夏来亲，这个姿势怎么样！？\n不对，这样……？脖子的角度再稍微……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_c:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a0610de015b83dce2408e0e977e23923ed3588347175539abc999681bd35907b",
      "text": "我觉得，挺帅的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_c:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a87e9bbc1e55bb2dcd2d0a07f357145cc036d940108517770a96a11be9cd5575",
      "text": "大家辛苦了。\n……等等，四季在干什么呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_c:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:29da50fba28aa287989b578dac4635bd79e9bf2df83885f268bdc1a985a95b26",
      "text": "如你所见，在研究上镜效果！\n难得拍写真，不好好耍个帅怎么行！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_c:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f080bc4cce7ce4cf9e3f7a10beb9493cec08f7ce26488bc57a8509109c0bb839",
      "text": "他说决定不下来到底摆什么姿势好呢。\n自从来了活动室，就一直在那折腾。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_c:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:48fa64bc92f66a5f30d6ce326fe4503111600d52b6ccafd90db63459662a7501",
      "text": "我……觉得都很帅……就是了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_c:cmd-000122:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5d27d8e2ae86d3580d167e6556ea3aea1ba3048ad5c111f1d3f3d309db117db5",
      "text": "哎！抢跑太狡猾了四季！\n我也要来！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_c:cmd-000133:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3d6eb1e1823aef95b7848b2978c98a8818bacdc71eee8e7c6b3b9c45203d96dd",
      "text": "哦，隼人也要来吗！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_c:cmd-000143:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e21ebcc0d7e47b6faa669dd10c7839c555f23249eee42f2a9336ce5d917c015e",
      "text": "唉……怎么总是这么吵吵闹闹的。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
